# ============================================================================
# User data / runtime state
# ============================================================================
# Polymath runtime state — user-local only
.polymath/
**/.polymath/
**/omni_index.db
**/omni_index.db-*
**/audit.jsonl
**/episodes/
# NOTE: scope workspace ignores to runtime/content dirs only — do NOT
# use a bare **/workspace/ which also nukes core-node/src/workspace/
# (the seeder + init source code). That bug left source uncommitted.
/workspace/
AGENT/
**/inbox/
**/memory-embeddings.db*
**/memory.db*
**/auth.key

