# ============================================================================
HANDOFF.md
IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md
**/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md

# ============================================================================
# Environment / secrets
# ============================================================================
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
!*.example.key

# ============================================================================
# User-authored skills (treat as private / commercial)
# Skills live in ~/.polymath/skills by default, but block any accidental
# in-repo skills/ folder so users or contributors don't publish their own
# skill IP if they work from inside the repo.
# ============================================================================
skills/
**/skills/
!core-node/docs/skills/
!website/docs/skills/

# ============================================================================
# Telegram / bot session state (run-time caches that might appear anywhere)
# ============================================================================
telegram_session*
bot-data/
**/bot-data/
tg-*.json
session.session
session.session-journal

# ============================================================================
# Temporary archives
# ============================================================================
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar

