# ============================================================
# Personal planning / setup notes (per-clone leak guard)
# Block any planning markdown a contributor might drop in by
# accident. The committed .gitignore catches generic patterns;
# specific filenames go in .git/info/exclude (per-clone).
# ============================================================
*-PLAN.md
*-INVENTORY.md
*-SETUP.md
*-FIX.md
**/CONTEXT-PACKAGE.md
**/Obsidian Vault/
**/PC App Documemtation/
!capabilities/*/SETUP.md
!core-node/docs/*-SETUP.md

# Editor workspace files
*.code-workspace
